  "details": "Feature request:\n\n- A **whisper** mode triggered by **raising one hand** to your mouth/head in VR (toggle/keybind on desktop) that **decreases** your voice falloff range making your voice **unheard by people not right next to you** so that you can have quick and easy asides that mimic what you probably do instinctively IRL\n\n- A **shout** mode triggered by **raising both hands** to your mouth/head in VR (toggle/keybind on desktop) that **increases** your voice falloff range so that you can be **heard from further away** to get peoples' attention more easily or convey information slightly further away in a way that intuitively mimics what you might do while shouting IRL",
